<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1921_7153.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründlich</unclear> willig dienst <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">samet</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> wir
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> liebs und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guots</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear> zuevor fromm
<lb n="3"/>fürsichtig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eersam</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear> insonders guot fründ
<lb n="4"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethrüw</unclear> lieb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eydtgnoßen</unclear>, wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weerd</unclear>-
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">end</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abermalen</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethrüwen</unclear> lieben
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtmans</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fridlij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Toelis</unclear></persName> seligen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlaßnen</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widtfrowen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstendiget</unclear>, wie dz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">et</unclear>-
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abglofner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zyth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> lybliche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bäßij</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dammel</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lederers</unclear></persName> seligen, von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gott</unclear> dem herren
<lb n="10"/>uß diser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zyth</unclear> beruefft worden, dardurch
<lb n="11"/>ihr haab und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoth</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einem</unclear> fryen erbfahl
<lb n="12"/>gerathen, welchem sy alß die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechte</unclear> groß-
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muodter</unclear> und vom <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bluot</unclear> die nechste, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lut</unclear> ewers
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbrechten</unclear> nachgesetzt, in hoffnung
<lb n="15"/>dz <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihra</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierin</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">luth</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üweres</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erbrechten</unclear> khein
<lb n="16"/>intrag beschechen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soelte</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">do</unclear> so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weerde</unclear> sy mit
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beduren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstendiget</unclear>, wie dz der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Loder</unclear>-
<lb n="18"/>herr, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stadtschryber</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Studer</unclear></persName> sich deße annem
<lb n="19"/>miet vermelden alß wan die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüdt</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stadtrechten</unclear> ze erben haben.
<lb n="21"/>Unß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> umb fründtlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">intercession</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>schryben angelangt, in hoffnung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deße</unclear> wol
<lb n="23"/>zuegenießen. Unnd wann wir nun
<lb n="24"/>deß handels und ursach deß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">intrags</unclear> wol
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear> empfangen, habend wir unß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deße</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwunderet</unclear>, dann wir wüßend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wan</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> unß derglychen erbfähl, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">froembde</unclear> ge-
<lb n="28"/>fallen
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1921_7154.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/>und gaegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Landleuthen</unclear>, zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gspan</unclear> khomen
<lb n="30"/>ist <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Raecht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alda</unclear> der erb-
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fahl</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gfallen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gzaogen</unclear> und nach den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydgnoessischen</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raechten</unclear> darumb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gricht</unclear> worden. Achtend auch
<lb n="33"/>es werde by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wenig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> by unß bedenckh-
<lb n="34"/>ens haben, dann dz die erb sollend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beraechtet</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>, an denen orten und enden, auch an
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">denen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raechten</unclear>, da die erb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gfallen</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgstorbnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sodßgfolen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ghaůßet</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwont</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">luth</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoeg</unclear> unser aller syts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuosam</unclear>-
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">en</unclear> habenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydgnoessischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pünten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jnhaltz</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundtbuochs</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Derowaegen</unclear> so ge-
<lb n="41"/>langt an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> gantz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydgnoessisch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründ</unclear>-
<lb n="42"/>lich püt, jr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellend</unclear> gedachte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">witt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fraw</unclear>, jn
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">oberkheitlichen</unclear> gnaden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erkhennen</unclear>, sy by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euwe</unclear>-
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rem</unclear> Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbraechten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schützen</unclear> und schirmen
<lb n="45"/>sy nach den selben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vmoeg</unclear> deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">puntsbuochs</unclear> erben
<lb n="46"/>lassen, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> allem dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhaelfen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syu</unclear>
<lb n="47"/>daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jren</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raecht</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billigkheidts</unclear> waegen
<lb n="48"/>ghoeren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirdt</unclear>. Daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begaeren</unclear> wir umb euch alß
<lb n="49"/>u. a. l. <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eydgnossen</orgName>, gantz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydgnoessisch</unclear> fründt-
<lb n="50"/>lich und guotwillig, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> tragenden glaegen-
<lb n="51"/>heiten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> beschulden, Gottes schirm daby
<lb n="52"/>beuelchende, datum den <origDate when="1614" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">15/5</unclear> tag Nouem-
